OL,3,GNEWSAVoting records show gender splits
OL,4,Aat rapist taxi driver licence row
OL,5,Acommittee
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe decision by a Highland Council
OL,8,Fcommittee to allow a convicted rapist
OL,9,Fto retain his taxi operator's licences
OL,10,Fsparked widespread criticism - and
OL,11,Fhighlights a striking pattern in how
OL,12,Fthe councillors voted.
OL,14,FAll four female councillors on the
OL,15,Flicensing committee voted to revoke the
OL,16,Flicences held by David Brown in June,
OL,17,Fwhile all six male councillors voted
OL,18,Fagainst the move.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
