OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVoting records show gender splits
OL,4,Aat rapist taxi driver licence row
OL,5,Acommittee
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe decision has sparked claims from
OL,8,Ffemale councillors that the men may
OL,9,Fhave displayed a level of unconscious
OL,10,Fbias and had not stuck to the strict
OL,11,Ffit and proper person test they should
OL,12,Fhave been applying.
OL,14,FThe men, most of whom have since
OL,15,Fresigned from the committee, have
OL,16,Fdefended their decisions and denied
OL,17,Fbeing misogynistic.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
